# Reviewed non-bucket analytics properties - privacy guardrail allowlist.
#
# Every allowlisted analytics property that does NOT end in "_bucket" must be
# listed here, one per line, as an explicit record that it was reviewed as a
# coarse enum / boolean / public version / count / coarse numeric diagnostic
# rather than free text. Tests/AnalyticsEventPolicyTests.swift enforces this
# against the compiled allowlist. Marked `merge=union` in .gitattributes; run
#   python3 scripts/ops/normalize-analytics-taxonomy.py
# after a union merge. Lines beginning with # are ignored.
